# Force LF on everything docker/sh consumes. CRLF in an entrypoint.sh or a
# healthcheck produces the classic "exec format error" / "no such file or
# directory" inside the container — the failure names the wrong thing entirely.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
